1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,961
What if everything around
you could become a 3D model?

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,091
Not in a studio. Right where you stand.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,502
Put on a headset, and the
world stops being a picture.

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,896
It becomes something you can
point at, take, and build with.

5
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,387
See that car? Point at it.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,281
The AI sees it, outlines it, and
rebuilds it in three dimensions.

7
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,650
Now imagine doing that to
power a whole village.

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:35,874
This is Mitsinjo Grid VR: a solar
village twin for off-grid Madagascar,

9
00:00:35,394 --> 00:00:38,920
running in the browser with
Meta's WebXR emulator.

10
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:42,141
On the Village page, I enter
VR immersion and look around.

11
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:45,154
One button analyses the current view.

12
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,970
Muse Spark detects every
object, SAM outlines it.

13
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:52,456
Each detection becomes a
hologram. I aim at the fridge…

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,037
…and shoot. Extract it in 3D? Yes.

15
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:01,069
In the 3D studio, Muse
Image draws its 2D views.

16
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:05,778
If a view is wrong, I ask the
AI chat, and it redraws it.

17
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:10,443
I validate, and the 3D model
is built, piece by piece.

18
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,218
Now, let's walk outside.

19
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,479
Through the hall, onto the
terrace, down to the street.

20
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:28,178
A car. One scan, and it is outlined.

21
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:31,731
Shoot, extract, check its views…

22
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:41,079
…and the car is rebuilt in 3D.

23
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:48,260
I place it on the village table
and insert it into the simulation.

24
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:55,621
Go to the simulation,
without leaving the headset.

25
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:58,696
Here I am, in the evening village.

26
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:03,012
A short walk through the
village, at human scale.

27
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,749
Labels, a live map, the
clinic, the houses.

28
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:13,819
It is evening. I limit
the power to the houses…

29
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:17,761
…and their lights fade gradually,
with the electrons on the cable.

30
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:22,005
Restore, and the houses light up again.

31
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:26,843
Inside, the lamp glows with the
power the house really gets.

32
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:31,707
At the dispatcher, a mixing
desk: one fader per sector.

33
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:37,320
Try to cut the clinic? Refused. The
village constitution protects it.

34
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:39,532
And back to the lab, in the same session.

35
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:43,681
Mitsinjo Grid VR. Point at the
world. Build it. Power it.

36
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:49,129
Every number comes from the engine.
Every action stays in human hands.
